<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n100928" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνοχος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνέχω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>joined together</i>: metaph., <i>in accord with</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παίγματα . . σύνοχα φοιτάσιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Ba.</u>
					164
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κακοῖς . . ξ. δάκρυα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Hel.</u>
					172
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>unintermittent</i>, of fevers, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Nat.Hom.</u>
				15
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Alex.Aphr.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				2.10
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				10.603
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				19.218
			</span></i> (who censures its use); distd. fr. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνεχής</span> (q.v.).</div>
